ode_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-22T14:16:27Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T15:02:32Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nWin 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nCopying and then pasting an animation into an animation library makes godot spam error messages. But only if you fold/unfold the animation library (at least once).\nIn the video the animaiton library is folded so I obviously have to unfold it but when you first time open a new animation library window the Global category is unfolded, at that moment it copy + pasting doesn't spam the error messages but once you fold and unfold it will start.\n\nError message:\n```\n  ERROR: scene/animation/animation_mixer.cpp:273 - Condition \"p_animation_library.is_null()\" is true. Returning: StringName()\n\n```\n\nVideo: https://youtu.be/cYSXvxbfwvw\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Fold the animation library once.\n2. Copy an aimation.\n3. Paste it into another animation library.\n4. Observer the terminal/output for errors.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[AnimLibIssues.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21939407/AnimLibIssues.zip)","closed_by":null,"reaction